# Paranal Airglow Line And Continuum Emission (PALACE) model: data and code of
# v1.0 (Noll et al. 2024)
# 
# Results of the evaluation of PALACE and the airglow component of the ESO Sky
# Model (noll+12) in comparison to X-shooter VIS-arm spectra
# 
# Column names:
# lam: central air wavelength of bin in µm
# lpix: lower pixel of bin in X-shooter VIS-arm spectra
# upix: upper pixel of bin in X-shooter VIS-arm spectra
# Nsel: number of selected X-shooter spectra
# mfx: mean flux of X-shooter data in R/nm
# mfp: mean flux of PALACE in R/nm
# mdfp: mean scatter of PALACE in R/nm
# mfo: mean flux of other sky radiation components from ESO Sky Model in R/nm
# fng: fraction of nightglow from ratio of mfp and mfp + mfo
# rdelp: relative deviation for PALACE (mfp / mfx - 1)
# rdp: relative scatter for PALACE (mdfp divided by standard deviation of
#      fp - fx from individual spectra)
# mfs: mean flux of airglow component of ESO Sky Model in R/nm
# mdfs: mean scatter of airglow component of ESO Sky Model in R/nm
# rdels: relative deviation for ESO Sky Model (mfs / mfx - 1)
# rds: relative scatter for ESO Sky Model (mdfs divided by standard deviation
#      of fs - fx from individual spectra)
# 
# References:
# noll+12: https://doi.org/10.1051/0004-6361/201219040
# 
